WEBVTT

NOTE key=bdece90aec1bafe3

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.821
It is night, and Juha is at the well.

2
00:00:03.321 --> 00:00:05.736
He looks down into the dark water.

3
00:00:06.236 --> 00:00:08.396
Oh no, the moon is in the well!

4
00:00:08.896 --> 00:00:11.740
"Poor moon," Juha says. "I can help."

5
00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:14.411
He gets a long rope and a hook.

6
00:00:14.911 --> 00:00:17.918
He pulls and pulls, and he falls down.

7
00:00:18.418 --> 00:00:20.531
Now Juha is on his back.

8
00:00:21.031 --> 00:00:23.005
He can see the moon in the sky.

9
00:00:23.505 --> 00:00:26.419
"Good," he says. "The moon is home again."
